        "Content": "Detached family residence built c.1984\r\n\r\nFurther potential to modernise\r\n\r\nPrestigious Ardeevin Road address\r\n\r\nFour generous bedrooms\r\n\r\nMagnificent split-level layout\r\n\r\nPrincipal suite with dressing room & ensuite\r\n\r\nThree reception rooms\r\n\r\nConservatory overlooking the gardens\r\n\r\nLandscaped mature gardens\r\n\r\nExtensive sun terraces\r\n\r\nElectric gated entrance\r\n\r\nGenerous gravel driveway\r\n\r\nExcellent family accommodation\r\n\r\nGas Fired Central Heating (GFCH)\r\n\r\nWalking distance to Dalkey village and DART\r\n\r\nExceptional opportunity to modernise and create a truly outstanding family home"
